        "command": "static-user 172.30.0.8 172.30.0.8 gateway 172.30.0.1 interface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.1 vlan 2005 qinq 510 mac-address 00e0-fc12-3456 detect",
        "explanation": "配置静态用户，IP地址为 172.30.0.8，网关为 172.30.0.1，接口为 GigabitEthernet2/0/0.1，VLAN为2005，QinQ VLAN为510，MAC地址为 00e0-fc12-3456，并启用检测",
